  "details": "Description\n\nYoutube doesn't work anymore on every worlds, I am not sure if it's only me or also other people. I've had issues with the video players for a few days already, I couldn't watch a more than a hour video (a playlist on youtube) and now nothing works anymore. Please help.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nI am not sure, I just try to put 20-40 minutes different playlists and nothing work.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: Other\n\n- Frequency: Always\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.1-1886-a268441585-Release\n\nunityVersion: 2022.3.22f2-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-08-19_20-57-32.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_d01b21aa-f563-4165-ad36-3872c722a908/1/file)",
